---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="container mx-auto flex flex-col items-center justify-center flex-1 px-6 md:px-12 py-20 gap-10 text-center">

    <!-- TÍTULO -->
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-mono font-bold text-[#cccccc] animate-fade-in">
      isaac@quezada:~$
    </h1>

    <!-- DESCRIPCIÓN -->
    <p class="text-base text-[#bbbbbb] max-w-2xl leading-relaxed animate-fade-in-up mt-6">
      I'm a DevOps engineer and cybersecurity specialist focused on automation, infrastructure hardening, and reliable systems. I build clean solutions.
    </p>

    <!-- BOTONES -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mt-10 animate-fade-in-up">
      <a href="/cv.pdf" class="px-5 py-2 border border-[#999] text-[#ccc] hover:bg-[#ccc] hover:text-black transition font-mono text-sm">
        >_ Download CV
      </a>
      <a href="/projects" class="px-5 py-2 border border-[#999] text-[#ccc] hover:bg-[#ccc] hover:text-black transition font-mono text-sm">
        >>> View Projects
      </a>
      <a href="/contact" class="px-5 py-2 border border-[#999] text-[#ccc] hover:bg-[#ccc] hover:text-black transition font-mono text-sm">
        ⎘ Contact Me
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- SKILLS EXTENDIDO -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-12 gap-y-4 text-sm text-[#aaaaaa] max-w-5xl mt-14 text-left animate-fade-in-up font-mono">
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li>// 20+ years building infrastructure for large enterprises and smaller organizations — Windows and Linux, across on-prem, cloud, and virtualized environments (KVM, VMware vSphere/ESXi).
        <li>// Cybersecurity focus aligned with NIST, CIS Benchmarks, and Australian/UK government standards. Familiar with MITRE ATT&CK and threat modeling.</li>
        <li>// Applied DevSecOps practices: container hardening, secret management, automated patching, policy enforcement and secure CI/CD workflows.</li>
      </ul>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li>// Experienced with AWS, GCP, and hybrid environments. Service mesh and identity-aware network design.</li>
        <li>// Deep knowledge in virtualization, VPNs, DNS, TLS, firewalls, and VLANs. Built zero-trust network foundations.</li>
        <li>// Strong background in observability: Prometheus, Grafana, ELK stack, uptime + alerting strategies.</li>
        <li>// Infrastructure-as-code and automation using Ansible, Python, Bash, and Terraform. Designed for resilience, performance.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
